graph LR
  H[Human<br/>approves chunks, reads diffs,<br/>decides what becomes a commit]
  C[Controller<br/>Opus 5.5, Fable 5.2 over six chunks<br/>holds plan + chunk summaries]
  IM[Implementer, low or medium risk<br/>Haiku 5.5, Sonnet 5.5 over two files]
  IO[Implementer, high risk<br/>Opus 5.5<br/>schema, auth, money, contracts]
  RV[Task reviewer, medium and high risk<br/>Sonnet 5.5, Opus 5.5 if high risk<br/>uses review-routing, read-only]
  RR[Scoped re-review<br/>Haiku 5.5]
  VF[Verifier, medium and high risk<br/>Sonnet 5.5, read-only<br/>runs the change]
  FW[Whole-tree review<br/>Opus 5.5]
  XM[Cross-model review<br/>Codex, different model family]
  H -- plan + next --> C
  C -- task by risk class --> IM
  C -- task by risk class --> IO
  IM -- diff, gate passed --> RV
  IO --> RV
  RV -- findings --> IM
  IM -- fix diff --> RR
  RV & RR -- fix rounds end --> VF
  VF -- FAIL --> IM
  VF -- done, high risk --> XM
  XM -- claims for a ruling --> C
  C -- after last chunk --> VF
  C -- after last chunk --> FW
  FW --> XM
  C -- chunk report --> H
